  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Trinket_items\" title=\"Category:Trinket items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Trinket.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Epic_Voice_of_the_Master\">Epic Voice of the Master</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #FFBBBB solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#FFBBBB;--bg-color-1-dark:#573F3F;--bg-color-2:#FFE4E1;--bg-color-2-dark:#3D2C2A;--header-color:#FFBBBB;--header-color-dark:#573F3F;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\">20\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Trinket_Generic_Voice.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Trinket_Generic_Voice.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Jewelry / Trinket\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Trinket\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">300\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a>:</b> Found only in meteorites and the rarest of veins in magical areas, this ultrahard metal adds to the quality of a weapon or suit of armor. Weapons made of adamantine have the ability to bypass the protective damage reduction of certain monsters.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">40\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008020000</span>8,020<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Delera%27s_Tomb\" title=\"Delera&#39;s Tomb\">Delera's Tomb</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heroic_Inspiration\" title=\"Heroic Inspiration\">Heroic Inspiration</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Heroic_Inspiration\" title=\"Heroic Inspiration\">Heroic Inspiration</a>:</b> This item inspires you to acts of great heroism, granting a +5% bonus to <a href=\"/page/Experience_point\" title=\"Experience point\">experience points</a> granted by completing quests while it is equipped. This stacks with experience boosting effects from <a href=\"/page/Item:Experience_Elixir\" title=\"Item:Experience Elixir\">elixirs</a> but does not stack with experience boosting effects from other equippable items.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Good_Luck\" title=\"Good Luck\">Good Luck  +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Good_Luck\" title=\"Good Luck\">Good Luck  +3</a>:</b> This item gives a +3 <a href=\"/page/Luck_bonus\" title=\"Luck bonus\">Luck bonus</a> to all saves and skill checks.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +30%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +30%</a>:</b> This item makes you more fleet of foot, giving you a 30% Enhancement bonus your movement speed.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment yellow\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Yellow Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment blue\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Blue Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Voice_of_the_Master.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Voice_of_the_Master.png/420px-Epic_Voice_of_the_Master.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"466\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Voice_of_the_Master.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A comforting and inspiring presence surrounds you as you hold this carving. A short chain of adamantine connects the carved head to a curiously shaped polyhedron with 20s carved on each side.</i>\n<p>This Minor Artifact has a maximum of one Filigree slot.<i></i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li>This <a href=\"/page/Minor_Artifact\" title=\"Minor Artifact\">Minor Artifact</a> has a maximum of 1 filigree slots.</li>\n<li>This <a href=\"/page/Minor_Artifact\" title=\"Minor Artifact\">artifact</a> <b>cannot</b> be upgraded beyond the initial slot despite stating <i>\"2000 XP for next slot\"</i>.  Any <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon/Filigrees\" title=\"Sentient Weapon/Filigrees\">Sentient XP</a> invested is <b>completely wasted</b>.</li>\n<li>This item can be used as part of the <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#DM&#39;s_Vision\" title=\"Named item sets\">DM's Vision</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#DM&#39;s_Vision\" title=\"Named item sets\">DM's Vision</a></b>: With the two original Dungeon Masters guiding you, you can see through most illusions and trickery. You are under the effects of the <a href=\"/page/True_Seeing\" title=\"True Seeing\">True Seeing</a> spell.</span></span> item set, along with the <a href=\"/page/Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mantle of the Worldshaper\">Mantle of the Worldshaper</a> from <a href=\"/page/The_Abandoned_Excavation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Abandoned Excavation\">The Abandoned Excavation</a>; in this case the Epic Voice will replace the heroic item <a href=\"/page/Item:Voice_of_the_Master\" title=\"Item:Voice of the Master\">Voice of the Master</a>. This will be less useful in the longer run, as both items and indeed the set become pretty weak in high epic levels, and unlike the Epic Voice, the standard heroic Voice can be equipped for the XP bonus while you are wearing another <a href=\"/page/Minor_Artifact\" title=\"Minor Artifact\">Minor Artifact</a>.</li>\n<li>The Epic Voice cannot be used to craft <a href=\"/page/Item:The_Master%27s_Gift\" title=\"Item:The Master&#39;s Gift\">The Master's Gift</a>.</li>\n<li>Many players don't slot this trinket (or its <a href=\"/page/Voice_of_the_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Voice of the Master\">heroic version</a>) until just before receiving XP at the end of a quest. When a party is about to fight the final boss or open the last chest, you will often hear a player say \"Voices!\" as a reminder to the group. In party chat, someone might type \"VOM\" to show that it's time to slot the trinket.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817205905\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.162 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3541/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32081/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12603/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n102.02%  143.086     53 Template:IO\n100.00%  140.252      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  140.252      1 -total\n 96.21%  134.937      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 37.25%   52.241      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 35.36%   49.587      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 33.46%   46.934      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.17%   43.721      2 Template:InCategory\n 19.60%   27.494      9 Template:Popup\n 15.51%   21.747      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:79178-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817205905 and revision id 630575. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Jewelry\n  | name                     = Epic Voice of the Master\n  | minlevel                 = 20\n  | type                     = Trinket\n  | race                     = \n  | slot                     = Trinket\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtA|BoA}}\n  | durability               = 300\n  | material                 = Adamantine\n  | hardness                 = 40\n  | basevalue                = 8,020 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | epic                     = no\n  | released                 = Update 45\n  | quest                    = Delera's Tomb\n  | end reward               = yes\n  | turn in                  = \n  | chest                    = \n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Heroic Inspiration}}\n* {{Good Luck|3}}\n* {{Striding|30}}\n* {{Augment|Yellow}}\n* {{Augment|Green}}\n* {{Augment|Blue}}\n  | crafting                 = \n  | craftingupgrade          = \n  | description              = A comforting and inspiring presence surrounds you as you hold this carving. A short chain of adamantine connects the carved head to a curiously shaped polyhedron with 20s carved on each side.\n\nThis Minor Artifact has a maximum of one Filigree slot.\n  | pic                      = Trinket Generic Voice.png\n  | picdesc                  = Epic Voice of the Master.png\n  | tips                     = \n* {{Minor Artifact|1}}\n* This [[Minor Artifact|artifact]] '''cannot''' be upgraded beyond the initial slot despite stating ''\"2000 XP for next slot\"''.  Any [[Sentient Weapon/Filigrees|Sentient XP]] invested is '''completely wasted'''.\n* This item can be used as part of the {{DM's Vision}} item set, along with the [[Mantle of the Worldshaper]] from [[The Abandoned Excavation]]; in this case the Epic Voice will replace the heroic item {{Item|Voice of the Master}}. This will be less useful in the longer run, as both items and indeed the set become pretty weak in high epic levels, and unlike the Epic Voice, the standard heroic Voice can be equipped for the XP bonus while you are wearing another [[Minor Artifact]].\n* The Epic Voice cannot be used to craft {{Item|The Master's Gift}}.\n* Many players don't slot this trinket (or its [[Voice of the Master|heroic version]]) until just before receiving XP at the end of a quest. When a party is about to fight the final boss or open the last chest, you will often hear a player say \"Voices!\" as a reminder to the group. In party chat, someone might type \"VOM\" to show that it's time to slot the trinket.\n}}",
